            "description": {
              "value": "Deception or Diplomacy; if you were already trained, you become an expert instead. You incorporate enough worship of Walkena in your daily life to avoid suspicion.\n\nYou typically don't need to Lie or Impersonate to pass yourself off as a worshipper of Walkena. Against careful inspection, you gain a +4 circumstance bonus to Deception checks specifically to pass yourself off as a version of yourself faithful to Walkena."
